ack (50% OFF FFHUB) 👉🏼 https://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/l...\n\nIn this FPL Gameweek 1 video, I discuss one of the major questions on everybody's mind right now: Should we go WITHOUT Haaland in GW1? 😬\n\n📧   Business inquiries: fplraptor@gmail.com\n\n🏆  Become a YT member: https://bit.ly/34AFdyn\n\n👀 Download PIX for free: https://get.mysportspix.app/?c=fplraptor\n⚽️ Download CLUB Here: https://clubga.me/UfSc/raptor\n\n📸  Follow my Instagram:   / fpl__raptor  \n🗣️  Follow my TikTok:   / fpl__raptor  \n🐦  Follow my X: https://x.com/FPL__Raptor\n\n🔗  Join my Mini League! Code: son7do\n\n📕  The Mind Game (Hard Copy): https://www.amazon.co.uk/Mind-Game-Ga...\n📲  The Mind Game (eBook): https://amzn.to/3FAJjUo\n\n0:00 = Intro\n0:45 = Pros and Cons\n12:49 = No Haaland Team\n18:02 = The Differences\n23:09 = Outro\n\n------------------------\n\nMusic from Uppbeat (free for Creators!):\nhttps://uppbeat.io/t/infraction/try\nhttps://uppbeat.io/t/zayner/falling\nhttps://uppbeat.io/t/qube/miracle\n\n------------------------\n\n#FantasyPremierLeague #FPL #PremierLeague","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":29,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwjt-vmL9quWAxWngIoHHVpXO71I2Ob9qoK31e0bygEECGe84g==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVEdOQkFtZmtGSnE4WEt0bVVkQ0xyaXxBR3JiS2FsNGhHbUJEbFV6WDFMd0NKckRVbV9pN3Y1RDVGRmZmX1hFU1RiOVVORzg5OXR2UVFQa2NzMm1HZkRXbmFUejduVVA3bnAzdXUzUkxMSE5UX01YV0Z3Wjd4SUlHV2Ff\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Fai-team-rating%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3Draptor%26utm_content%3Dteam-rating%26via%3Draptor\u0026v=G9tVuCVfc1g","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVEdOQkFtZmtGSnE4WEt0bVVkQ0xyaXxBR3JiS2FsNGhHbUJEbFV6WDFMd0NKckRVbV9pN3Y1RDVGRmZmX1hFU1RiOVVORzg5OXR2UVFQa